[05/13 23:46:42     31s]                                   # design. (string, optional)
[05/13 23:46:42     31s] -format <string>                  # Specifies the net activity of the design
[05/13 23:46:42     31s]                                   # using an activity file in VCD, TCF, FSDB,
[05/13 23:46:42     31s]                                   # PHY or SAIF format. (string, optional)
